# Normalize line endings to LF in the working tree on every platform.
# CORE's frontmatter parsers detect the `---\n` delimiter; a CRLF checkout on
# Windows/OneDrive would otherwise break unit parsing silently (review M1).
*.md   text eol=lf
*.mjs  text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf
